{"name": "Zombies Hate to Die", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A proper Character Action Game \u2014 third-person slashing and hacking, no auto-combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wasteland survival rules: precise slashing, slick footwork \u2014 don't die stupid, and make sure you look good doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/b6f1430b1098d6646b11a004a5401d2c.poster.avif?t=1787940288\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/b6f1430b1098d6646b11a004a5401d2c.webm?t=1787940288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/b6f1430b1098d6646b11a004a5401d2c.mp4?t=1787940288\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When outmatched, throw a rock. Or chant a spell. Or elegantly set something on fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/299a6281b86cee33b38aa942c1bf2924.poster.avif?t=1787940288\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/299a6281b86cee33b38aa942c1bf2924.webm?t=1787940288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/299a6281b86cee33b38aa942c1bf2924.mp4?t=1787940288\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way from one broken station to the next. Scavenge some gasoline, canned food, and those shiny zombie crystals along the way (rumoured to be tradable for gear \u2014 or maybe just a pile of junk).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/f69923a3141e19e4cf0a2648aaec3e04.poster.avif?t=1787940288\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/f69923a3141e19e4cf0a2648aaec3e04.webm?t=1787940288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/f69923a3141e19e4cf0a2648aaec3e04.mp4?t=1787940288\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your backpack is only so big. Bring the katana, or the neighbourhood-waking megaphone? Cleaver, fork, steroids, running shoes, jet booster, quantum blade, fireworks, petrol bomb, soul-binding charm, undead convoy, rubber chicken\u2026 The more absurd the combo, the higher your survival odds (or maybe the opposite).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/6380bb9fe482f2bb78384c96188537df.avif?t=1787940288\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every station is a little different:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Abandoned Block:</strong> Nothing unexpected here \u2014 probably!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demon District:</strong> The zombies there are a bit unhinged, but there's extra loot too. Tough call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Abandoned Gas Station:</strong> Stock up on fuel and save yourself some travel time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Abandoned Supermarket:</strong> Plenty of food to keep you going a few more days \u2014 or sell for cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shop:</strong> Might just find something lovely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hospital:</strong> Think the nurse will give you a discount?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Synthesis Plant:</strong> Dead end or last resort? Either way, you've got nothing left to lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/ba2b6b830f8e428b5e209b112aa32d58.poster.avif?t=1787940288\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/ba2b6b830f8e428b5e209b112aa32d58.webm?t=1787940288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/ba2b6b830f8e428b5e209b112aa32d58.mp4?t=1787940288\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The map is a spiderweb, and Demon District is waving at you. Which route? Pick the craziest one \u2014 none of them lead to a long life anyway, so you might as well die with style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/23a304fd30cbc800386393a82ee8d9eb.poster.avif?t=1787940288\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/23a304fd30cbc800386393a82ee8d9eb.webm?t=1787940288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/23a304fd30cbc800386393a82ee8d9eb.mp4?t=1787940288\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now get moving. Make those zombies regret crawling out of their graves!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Zombies are coming \u2014 run to the shelter now! Slash through with precise physics combat, while looting, upgrading, and equipping absurd gear. A light Roguelite loop where every escape is a fresh journey.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/20c8dd340e12aa8b6f65f349499a06d3b6513089/header.jpg?t=1787940288", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Inventory Management", "Character Action Game", "Post-apocalyptic", "Hack and Slash", "Action RPG"], "developers": "KungFolio", "publishers": "KungFolio", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3970080", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "30 January 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/8lxYIqVsaYE", "first_seen": 1769727600.0, "review_rank": 1306}